_is_actual.actual_intro _\n        (fun everyone_including h => everyone_including ⟨MetaBias, h⟩))\n      everyone_makes_mistakes)\n    i_am_a_person\n\nend kzc1ea04\n","members":[],"source_lines":{"end":22,"start":22},"theorem_statement":null},"referenced_by":[]}
